<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila firm seeks tenders for 40,000 T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Manila firm seeks tenders for 40,000 T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of the Philippines largest flour millers sought tenders on Wednesday for the supply of 40,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, Manila traders said.</p>
</text>
